CM_ "PT-CAN (VCU to DTI HV-550 CAN2 port), 500 kbit/s (baud rate set in DTI Tool, unverified), 29-bit extended IDs. Contains only the COMMANDS the VCU may send. The DTI STATUS messages are intentionally absent: their IDs, byte layout and CAN map version are not verified. They are added only from a bench capture (test T-DTI-1) with Verification BENCH:<capture>.";
CM_ BO_ 2147483926 "Set current (packet 0x01). ID = (packet << 8) | node, node 0x16 is a project choice. Value = amps x 1000 per DTI CAN description V1.3. Big-endian byte order comes from the VESC lineage and is UNVERIFIED (tests T-DTI-1/T-DTI-2). Sign = torque direction; the regen method is decided by T-DTI-5.";
CM_ BO_ 2147484182 "Set brake current (packet 0x02). The DTI ignores the sign (V1.3); the VCU always sends the magnitude. Candidate regen mechanism (T-DTI-5).";
CM_ BO_ 2147486742 "Max AC current (packet 0x0C). BLOCKED in firmware until test T-DTI-6 passes; reduce-only. Sign convention unverified.";
CM_ BO_ 2147486998 "Max AC brake current (packet 0x0D). BLOCKED until T-DTI-6; reduce-only. Sign convention unverified.";
CM_ BO_ 2147487254 "Max DC current (packet 0x0E). BLOCKED until T-DTI-6; reduce-only. Sign convention unverified.";
CM_ BO_ 2147487510 "Max DC brake current (packet 0x0F). BLOCKED until T-DTI-6; reduce-only. Sign convention unverified.";

